# FixFlags UI

Before editing UI, read `/AGENTS.md`, `lib/design/brand-rules.md`, `lib/design/tokens.css`, and `DESIGN.md`.

## Stack

Tailwind + shadcn. Use semantic tokens (`bg-card`, `text-brand`, `shadow-card`, `rounded-card`), never raw hex except `grade.*`.

## Color

60% canvas (`background` white / dark ink) · 30% structure (`foreground`, stone `card`/`muted`) · 10% brand orange (`brand`). One accent per surface. Product primary CTAs = ink on light; marketing accent CTAs = `variant="brand"`; dark-mode primary CTAs = orange.

## Depth

Shadow-first. Cards: `border-0 shadow-card glass-surface`. Sections: `bg-muted/35`, not `border-y`. Borders only on inputs and table rows.

## Type

`font-sans` (Inter) body · `font-display` / `font-serif` (Inter Tight) for marketing headlines and wordmark · `font-mono` (JetBrains Mono) for scores, grades, uppercase labels. `text-balance` headings, `text-pretty` body, `tabular-nums` on numbers. Never display weight on dense report UI.

## Layout

Report pages: `Container variant="report"` (`max-w-6xl`). Marketing: `default` (`max-w-5xl`). Marketing full mesh (`GlobalMeshBackdrop intensity="full"`) has no hero grid.

## Report hierarchy

Read `knowledge/report-contract.md`. `/report/[id]` is the focused three-item Finish Plan. `/report/[id]/details` is the full inspection workspace. Anonymous viewers get three problem/evidence summaries and exactly one complete fix. Keep advanced controls off the first-use surface. Progressive UI builds toward three plan cards. Verify 375, 768, and 1280px plus keyboard, zoom/reflow, loading, partial, error, and reduced-motion states.

## Radius

Concentric: inner = outer − padding. Controls/buttons/inputs: `rounded-[var(--radius-control)]` (~10px). Cards/panels: `rounded-card`. Filter chips / avatars / switches may stay fully round as geometric shapes.

## Mark

Official brand-sheet mark raster only (`/brand/logo-mark.png`). Do not invent SVG geometry or reintroduce the old 3D pennant.

## Marketing visuals

Never soft-key black-background plates into alpha without unmatting — dark RGB on partial alpha creates a black fringe. On mesh/gradient marketing pages, ship properly unmated RGBA (despill edges; no dark semi-transparent pixels). Opaque bake onto `#FFFFFF` only when the canvas is flat white. Prefer a white-mockup crop when available. Do not re-trim/re-key clean RGBA masters.

## Anti-slop

No icon grids, gradient heroes, colored trend pills, `transition: all`, or default blue stacks. Sentence case. Real product screenshots over illustrations.

## Polish

`active:scale-[0.98]` on buttons · layered shadows · `prefers-reduced-motion` · focus rings on `--ring` · 44×44px min hit targets (`min-h-11 min-w-11`).
